# A long meeting table for four, with a notepad at each seat. Odds working
# together on one piece of work sit along the north side facing the room; put
# a kitchen-chair on each seat tile.
sprite meeting-table
size 64 26
layer object
footprint 4 1
origin 0 10
tag table meeting meet
spot seat-0 0 -1 down meet sit
spot seat-1 1 -1 down meet sit
spot seat-2 2 -1 down meet sit
spot seat-3 3 -1 down meet sit
variant walnut o=w O=W 1=3 2=3
variant ash o=a O=A 1=4 2=4

frame default
